{"data": [{"author_id": "860158302", "created_at": "2026-11-10T17:04:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120200832041779468"], "id": "2120200832041779468", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2598, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Researchers have studied the phenomenon of introspection in humans and animals for over a century — and now they’re turning their attention to new subjects: large language models. Can they also look inside themselves? Tune into the latest episode of The Quanta Podcast:", "url": "https://x.com/QuantaMagazine/status/2120200832041779468"}, {"author_id": "3290364847", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:40:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120194793577853438"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The FDA on Monday warned that GLP-1 drugs carry a potential risk for a rare but serious eye condition that's sometimes referred to as an \"eye stroke.\"", "display_url": "statnews.com/2026/11/09/glp…", "end": 214, "expanded_url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/09/glp-1-drugs-potential-risk-rare-eye-condition-naion-fda/", "images": [{"height": 576, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119822098252357632/UHaP3Me_?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1024}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119822098252357632/UHaP3Me_?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 191, "status": 200, "title": "FDA warns GLP-1 drugs carry potential risk of rare eye condition", "unwound_url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/09/glp-1-drugs-potential-risk-rare-eye-condition-naion-fda/", "url": "https://t.co/xu1PtPQcH5"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/eC3sK6Qsr3", "end": 238, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/statnews/status/2120194793577853438/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120194790792769536", "start": 215, "url": "https://t.co/eC3sK6Qsr3"}]}, "id": "2120194793577853438", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1179, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "The Food and Drug Administration warned that GLP-1 drugs carry a potential risk for a rare but serious eye condition and required pharma companies to inform patients and doctors of the risk. https://t.co/xu1PtPQcH5 https://t.co/eC3sK6Qsr3", "url": "https://x.com/statnews/status/2120194793577853438"}, {"author_id": "15862891", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:32:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120192762544791708"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature - The X-ray visualization platform TomoSAXS, demonstrated here on intervertebral spinal discs, can visualize nanoscale to macroscale mechanics in intact biological organs and fibrous materials.", "display_url": "go.nature.com/485DZZ9", "end": 109, "expanded_url": "https://go.nature.com/485DZZ9", "images": [{"height": 1622, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120192782811701248/gA6qvvda?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1793}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120192782811701248/gA6qvvda?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 86, "status": 200, "title": "Multimodal X-ray imaging reveals hierarchical fibre mechanics", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-11148-5?utm_source=x&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=nature&linkId=64326664&error=cookies_not_supported&code=ce4a467b-dff6-42c9-97ac-d6584165a6be", "url": "https://t.co/yttOUdmxM4"}]}, "id": "2120192762544791708", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 7535, "like_count": 25, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "Nature research paper: Multimodal X-ray imaging reveals hierarchical fibre mechanics\n\nhttps://t.co/yttOUdmxM4", "url": "https://x.com/Nature/status/2120192762544791708"}, {"author_id": "3290364847", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:14:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120188398698660016"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Dutch anti-trust regulators are investigating allegations that Biogen may have abused its dominant position in the market for MS treatments and associated blood tests.", "display_url": "trib.al/RfvxUYG", "end": 191, "expanded_url": "https://trib.al/RfvxUYG", "images": [{"height": 576, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120155133904556032/d6QocMgN?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1024}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120155133904556032/d6QocMgN?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 168, "status": 200, "title": "Dutch antitrust regulators probe Biogen over test for its MS drug", "unwound_url": "https://www.statnews.com/pharmalot/2026/11/10/dutch-antitrust-regulators-probe-biogen-over-multiple-sclerosis-drug-test/?utm_campaign=twitter_organic&utm_source=twitter&utm_medium=social", "url": "https://t.co/81OMWqIwcZ"}]}, "id": "2120188398698660016", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1161, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Dutch anti-trust regulators are investigating allegations that Biogen may have abused its dominant position in the market for MS treatments and associated blood tests. https://t.co/81OMWqIwcZ", "url": "https://x.com/statnews/status/2120188398698660016"}, {"author_id": "3290364847", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:09:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120187159910940816"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "PepGen says its candidate is correcting more of the genetic stutter found in myotonic dystrophy type 1.", "display_url": "statnews.com/2026/11/10/mus…", "end": 212, "expanded_url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/10/muscular-dystrophy-dm1-pepgen-pgn-edodm1-early-results/", "images": [{"height": 576, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120125955951706113/cziJDfAx?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1024}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120125955951706113/cziJDfAx?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 189, "status": 200, "title": "PepGen says early trial for muscular dystrophy drug looks promising", "unwound_url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/10/muscular-dystrophy-dm1-pepgen-pgn-edodm1-early-results/", "url": "https://t.co/u1utzroclT"}]}, "id": "2120187159910940816", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1106, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The biotech PepGen said that its experimental drug had shown, by one key measure, the most promising early data yet in the race to treat a muscle disorder that affects over 100,000 people. https://t.co/u1utzroclT", "url": "https://x.com/statnews/status/2120187159910940816"}, {"author_id": "32372834", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:00:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120184809137856563"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 55, "start": 45, "tag": "psoriasis"}], "mentions": [{"end": 157, "id": "4002598402", "start": 143, "username": "SciImmunology"}], "urls": [{"description": "Structural insights reveal how IL-36R is activated by distinct cytokines and antagonized by spesolimab.", "display_url": "scim.ag/4Am3Ubb", "end": 182, "expanded_url": "https://scim.ag/4Am3Ubb", "images": [{"height": 615, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118802671700230144/u8XN3vQh?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 800}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118802671700230144/u8XN3vQh?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 159, "status": 200, "title": "The structural basis of IL-36R proinflammatory signaling mediated by IL-36γ and IL-37", "unwound_url": "https://www.science.org/doi/10.1126/sciimmunol.adw5770?utm_campaign=ScienceMagazine&utm_medium=ownedSocial&utm_source=twitter", "url": "https://t.co/kBEGbhbs5g"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/fz78IEgB53", "end": 206, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2120184809137856563/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120184807086821377", "start": 183, "url": "https://t.co/fz78IEgB53"}]}, "id": "2120184809137856563", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 7381, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "The drug spesolimab for generalized pustular #psoriasis targets the IL-36 receptor in skin cells. But how exactly does it work? \n\nRead more in @SciImmunology: https://t.co/kBEGbhbs5g https://t.co/fz78IEgB53", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2120184809137856563"}, {"author_id": "14499829", "created_at": "2026-11-10T15:49:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120182102738038820"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 66, "start": 54, "tag": "ChildSummit"}], "mentions": [{"end": 26, "id": "972621599223549953", "start": 10, "username": "ParisPeaceForum"}, {"end": 37, "id": "189868631", "start": 28, "username": "DrTedros"}], "urls": [{"description": "LIVE from @ParisPeaceForum: @DrTedros’ remarks at the #ChildSummit High-Level Plenary", "display_url": "x.com/i/broadcasts/2…", "end": 109, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/broadcasts/2rJXOAOQpnnJkd", "images": [{"height": 1080, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120182145389903872/9--p8j2I?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1920}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120182145389903872/9--p8j2I?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 86, "status": 200, "title": "World Health Organization (WHO)", "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/broadcasts/2rJXOAOQpnnJkd", "url": "https://t.co/8SCsgNYp6R"}]}, "id": "2120182102738038820", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 24118, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 14}, "text": "LIVE from @ParisPeaceForum: @DrTedros’ remarks at the #ChildSummit High-Level Plenary https://t.co/8SCsgNYp6R", "url": "https://x.com/WHO/status/2120182102738038820"}, {"author_id": "86626845", "created_at": "2026-11-10T15:33:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120177917141610831"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 116, "id": "208120290", "start": 112, "username": "FDA"}, {"end": 196, "id": "1300691611", "start": 185, "username": "AlexLJanin"}], "urls": [{"description": "The FDA is requiring the makers of drugs like Ozempic and Zepbound to include warnings about a rare eye condition that can cause permanent vision loss.", "display_url": "wsj.com/health/pharma/…", "end": 181, "expanded_url": "https://www.wsj.com/health/pharma/u-s-regulators-warn-glp-1-drugs-carry-possible-rare-blindness-risk-c36a4564?st=LjewJZ&reflink=desktopwebshare_permalink", "images": [{"height": 640, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120177919578488833/3DxWC7Nf?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120177919578488833/3DxWC7Nf?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 158, "status": 200, "title": "U.S. Regulators Warn GLP-1 Drugs Carry Possible Rare Blindness Risk", "unwound_url": "https://www.wsj.com/health/pharma/u-s-regulators-warn-glp-1-drugs-carry-possible-rare-blindness-risk-c36a4564?st=LjewJZ&reflink=desktopwebshare_permalink", "url": "https://t.co/1pTdr8MnfE"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/FEkQRPTteQ", "end": 220, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EricTopol/status/2120177917141610831/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120177122773975040", "start": 197, "url": "https://t.co/FEkQRPTteQ"}]}, "id": "2120177917141610831", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 55, "impression_count": 21375, "like_count": 169, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 19, "retweet_count": 48}, "text": "The risk of blindness associated with GLP-1 drugs is ~2/100,000 people taking these drugs and properly noted by @FDA, the very rare condition known as NAION \nhttps://t.co/1pTdr8MnfE by @AlexLJanin https://t.co/FEkQRPTteQ", "url": "https://x.com/EricTopol/status/2120177917141610831"}, {"author_id": "860158302", "created_at": "2026-11-10T15:28:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120176662725718278"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "When researchers gave a genetic molecule the ability to replicate, it evolved over time into a complex network of “hosts” and “parasites” that both competed and cooperated to survive.", "display_url": "quantamagazine.org/in-test-tubes-…", "end": 267, "expanded_url": "https://www.quantamagazine.org/in-test-tubes-rna-molecules-evolve-into-a-tiny-ecosystem-20220505/", "start": 244, "status": 200, "title": "In Test Tubes, RNA Molecules Evolve Into a Tiny Ecosystem | Quanta Magazine", "unwound_url": "https://www.quantamagazine.org/in-test-tubes-rna-molecules-evolve-into-a-tiny-ecosystem-20220505/", "url": "https://t.co/FfgcyUz7UU"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/AwoduJFehA", "end": 291, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/QuantaMagazine/status/2120176662725718278/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120176659684786176", "start": 268, "url": "https://t.co/AwoduJFehA"}]}, "id": "2120176662725718278", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 3096, "like_count": 40, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "In the 1960s, the molecular biologist Sol Spiegelman created a synthetic mutating strand of RNA and nicknamed it “the little monster.” His studies were the world’s first experimental demonstration of Darwinian evolution at the molecular level. https://t.co/FfgcyUz7UU https://t.co/AwoduJFehA", "url": "https://x.com/QuantaMagazine/status/2120176662725718278"}, {"author_id": "860158302", "created_at": "2026-11-10T15:28:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120176658976031043"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The earliest life forms may have emerged from self-copying RNA.", "display_url": "quantamagazine.org/did-life-begin…", "end": 229, "expanded_url": "https://www.quantamagazine.org/did-life-begin-in-an-rna-world-20261109/", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119814789761257472/iy1Y9Ey1?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119814789761257472/iy1Y9Ey1?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 206, "status": 200, "title": "Did Life Begin in an RNA World? | Quanta Magazine", "unwound_url": "https://www.quantamagazine.org/did-life-begin-in-an-rna-world-20261109/", "url": "https://t.co/TmrCbJLVAD"}]}, "id": "2120176658976031043", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 3965, "like_count": 58, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "RNA isn’t “alive” in itself. It’s easy to imagine, however, how early RNA molecules could evolve into forms that catalyzed metabolic processes. This may be the story behind Earth’s first living protocells. https://t.co/TmrCbJLVAD", "url": "https://x.com/QuantaMagazine/status/2120176658976031043"}, {"author_id": "86626845", "created_at": "2026-11-10T15:23:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120175596336767104"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 258, "id": "26832834", "start": 243, "username": "NatureMedicine"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/gKcgrlpmpV", "end": 282, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EricTopol/status/2120175596336767104/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120174874698407936", "start": 259, "url": "https://t.co/gKcgrlpmpV"}]}, "id": "2120175596336767104", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 58, "impression_count": 15701, "like_count": 142, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 32}, "text": "Notable: Researchers from 50 institutions collaborate to find a biomarker that has the potential to detect ovarian cancer very early, even pre-malignant\nA cancer not detected by the Galleri test. \nAn extracellular vesicle long non-coding RNA \n@NatureMedicine https://t.co/gKcgrlpmpV", "url": "https://x.com/EricTopol/status/2120175596336767104"}, {"author_id": "3290364847", "created_at": "2026-11-10T15:20:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120174838505480375"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Texas, Georgia, and Wisconsin may expand their Medicaid programs when Democrats take power.", "display_url": "statnews.com/2026/11/10/med…", "end": 162, "expanded_url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/10/medicaid-expansion-holdout-states-midterm-election-power-shift/", "images": [{"height": 576, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120102954094981120/t8v_EQ0g?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1024}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120102954094981120/t8v_EQ0g?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 139, "status": 200, "title": "State Democratic wins make Medicaid expansion a possibility for more than a million people", "unwound_url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/10/medicaid-expansion-holdout-states-midterm-election-power-shift/", "url": "https://t.co/YkO5vxln10"}]}, "id": "2120174838505480375", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1209, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Three holdout states could reconsider Medicaid expansion after Democratic election victories shift power in Texas, Georgia, and Wisconsin. https://t.co/YkO5vxln10", "url": "https://x.com/statnews/status/2120174838505480375"}, {"author_id": "3290364847", "created_at": "2026-11-10T15:18:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120174307095543983"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The FDA warned that GLP-1 drugs carry a potential risk of a rare but serious eye condition sometimes referred to as an “eye stroke.”", "display_url": "trib.al/YCQZ7TY", "end": 156, "expanded_url": "https://trib.al/YCQZ7TY", "images": [{"height": 576, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120167901877440512/YtchWi5J?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1024}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120167901877440512/YtchWi5J?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 133, "status": 200, "title": "GLP-1s are given an FDA warning for rare eye condition risk", "unwound_url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/10/biotech-news-glp-1-given-an-fda-warning-for-rare-eye-condition-risk/?utm_campaign=twitter_organic&utm_source=twitter&utm_medium=social", "url": "https://t.co/YD0pHEXddz"}]}, "id": "2120174307095543983", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1187, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The FDA warned that GLP-1 drugs carry a potential risk of a rare but serious eye condition sometimes referred to as an “eye stroke.” https://t.co/YD0pHEXddz", "url": "https://x.com/statnews/status/2120174307095543983"}, {"author_id": "3290364847", "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:53:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120167895732715897"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The FDA warned that GLP-1 drugs carry a potential risk of a rare but serious eye condition sometimes referred to as an “eye stroke.”", "display_url": "trib.al/Vryn60B", "end": 279, "expanded_url": "https://trib.al/Vryn60B", "images": [{"height": 576, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120167901877440512/YtchWi5J?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1024}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120167901877440512/YtchWi5J?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 256, "status": 200, "title": "GLP-1s are given an FDA warning for rare eye condition risk", "unwound_url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/10/biotech-news-glp-1-given-an-fda-warning-for-rare-eye-condition-risk/?utm_campaign=twitter_organic&utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter", "url": "https://t.co/sWBGo4mQDj"}]}, "id": "2120167895732715897", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1539, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "GLP-1 drugs have exploded in popularity in a relatively short window of time.\n\nBut as with any drugs given to large populations, side effects can show up in real-world use that weren’t observed in trials.\n\nRead more about the FDA's warning on GLP-1s here: https://t.co/sWBGo4mQDj", "url": "https://x.com/statnews/status/2120167895732715897"}, {"author_id": "32372834", "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:36:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120163576170037407"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 23, "start": 9, "tag": "ScienceReview"}], "urls": [{"description": "Pharmacotherapies for obesity and type 2 diabetes are increasingly being evaluated for their effects on cognition and brain health. Evidence from preclinical models, observational cohorts, and clinical trials has intensified interest, but findings remain ...", "display_url": "scim.ag/4k1BH4z", "end": 190, "expanded_url": "https://scim.ag/4k1BH4z", "images": [{"height": 550, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118429492230438913/LY4LqRjy?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 715}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118429492230438913/LY4LqRjy?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 167, "status": 200, "title": "Obesity pharmacotherapies and cognition", "unwound_url": "https://www.science.org/doi/10.1126/science.aek9987?utm_campaign=ScienceMagazine&utm_medium=ownedSocial&utm_source=twitter", "url": "https://t.co/YUgIt8wxFI"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/0DyUnZnQjm", "end": 214, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2120163576170037407/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120163573569654784", "start": 191, "url": "https://t.co/0DyUnZnQjm"}]}, "id": "2120163576170037407", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 31, "impression_count": 12456, "like_count": 86, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 19}, "text": "In a new #ScienceReview, researchers discuss the emerging effects obesity medications, such as GLP-1-based therapies, have on cognition and brain health.\n\nLearn more: https://t.co/YUgIt8wxFI https://t.co/0DyUnZnQjm", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2120163576170037407"}, {"author_id": "3290364847", "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:27:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120161524350083498"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The FDA approved a novel drug to reduce recurrence of stroke, the agency is warning that GLP-1s carry a potential risk for an eye condition, and more pharma news of the day.", "display_url": "trib.al/tgusFLO", "end": 189, 